\b 1. Tool Overview\b0\par
\par
This is an internal automation tool for managing Google Ads Search campaigns for Vats Apartment, a PG (paying guest) accommodation business near LPU University, Jalandhar, Punjab, India. The tool uses the Google Ads API (v20) to automate campaign management tasks.\par
\par
\b 2. Business Context\b0\par
\par
- Business: PG accommodation provider offering 1BHK, 2BHK, and Penthouse rooms\par
- Website: https://vatsapartment.com\par
- Target audience: Students and professionals seeking housing near LPU University\par
- Campaign type: Google Search Ads only\par
- Monthly budget: INR 10,000-15,000\par
- Target CPA: INR 2,000 per confirmed room booking\par
\par
\b 3. API Features Used\b0\par
\par
The tool uses the following Google Ads API services:\par
\par
\b 3.1 Campaign Management\b0\par
- GoogleAdsService.Search/SearchStream - Query campaign performance data\par
- CampaignService - Manage campaign settings and budgets\par
- CampaignBudgetService - Adjust daily budgets\par
\par
\b 3.2 Keyword Management\b0\par
- AdGroupCriterionService - Add, remove, and pause keywords\par
- CampaignCriterionService - Manage negative keywords at campaign level\par
- Keyword reporting via GAQL queries\par
\par
\b 3.3 Conversion Tracking\b0\par
- ConversionActionService - Create and manage conversion actions\par
- Phone call conversion tracking\par
- WhatsApp click tracking via GTM integration\par
\par
\b 3.4 Reporting\b0\par
- Performance reports (impressions, clicks, CTR, CPC, conversions)\par
- Keyword performance analysis\par
- Search term reports for negative keyword discovery\par
\par
\b 4. Architecture\b0\par
\par
The tool is a server-side automation built with:\par
- Language: Shell scripts using curl (REST API calls)\par
- Auth: OAuth2 with refresh token, hosted in .env file\par
- API version: Google Ads API v20\par
- Execution: Manual or cron-based scheduled runs\par
\par
\b 5. Workflow\b0\par
\par
Step 1: Authenticate using OAuth2 refresh token to get access token\par
Step 2: Query current campaign and keyword data using GAQL\par
Step 3: Analyze keyword performance (remove low-volume, add new keywords)\par
Step 4: Update keywords via AdGroupCriterionService.mutate\par
Step 5: Update negative keywords via CampaignCriterionService.mutate\par
Step 6: Generate performance reports\par
\par
\b 6. Access Level\b0\par
\par
We are requesting Basic Access level. Our expected API usage:\par
- Operations per day: Less than 500 (well within 15,000 daily limit)\par
- Frequency: Weekly keyword reviews, monthly campaign adjustments\par
- Accounts managed: 1 (our own Vats Apartment account, 644-356-8695)\par
\par
\b 7. Compliance\b0\par
\par
- The tool will only be used for our own Google Ads account\par
- No external users or clients will have access\par
- All API usage complies with Google Ads API Terms of Service\par
- The tool will not create ads automatically; it only manages keywords and reports\par
- Rate limits will be respected with appropriate backoff handling\par
